[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3245.23, "timestamp": "00:54:05", "text": "去你的，蒙。这一切都是因为你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3247.75, "timestamp": "00:54:07", "text": "哦，你感觉怎么样？你感觉如何，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3251.51, "timestamp": "00:54:11", "text": "哥们儿？你感觉怎么样？你感觉良好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3255.03, "timestamp": "00:54:15", "text": "对自己的儿子做出这种事，你会作何感想？是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3258.069, "timestamp": "00:54:18", "text": "这就是你想要的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3270.39, "timestamp": "00:54:30", "text": "等等，你们在Twitch上用共享聊天功能吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3276.47, "timestamp": "00:54:36", "text": "我不想做，因为它就像混音一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3279.43, "timestamp": "00:54:39", "text": "聊天记录。是的，读起来会很费劲。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3281.19, "timestamp": "00:54:41", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3285.589, "timestamp": "00:54:45", "text": "或许有这样的设备能帮上忙，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3289.349, "timestamp": "00:54:49", "text": "是的。我的意思是，Twitch 大概就是吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3299.67, "timestamp": "00:54:59", "text": "我开始在这个屏幕上直播。"}]